{"id":"9e7a8687a65c356f","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-t-axiom.md","title":"Axiom T","display":"df-t-axiom — Axiom T","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-t-axiom","aliases":["89-df-t-axiom"],"display":"df-t-axiom — Axiom T","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-box-modality]]","[[89-df-modal-implication]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-t-axiom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-t-axiom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-t-axiom — Axiom T"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"32c9990061b9749d\" href=\"?note=32c9990061b9749d\" title=\"89-df-modal-implication\">89-df-modal-implication</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-t-axiom-—-Axiom-T-(Factivity)\">df-t-axiom — Axiom T (Factivity)</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\Box:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{2}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\to:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{2}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> are fixed by\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"32c9990061b9749d\" href=\"?note=32c9990061b9749d\" title=\"89-df-modal-implication\">89-df-modal-implication</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}t\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{A}_{T}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Box A\\to A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}t\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{A}_{T}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Box A\\to A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A}_{T}\">\\(\\mathcal{A}_{T}\\)</span> 是公理 T 的全部代入实例。</li>\n<li>&quot;若我知道<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>为真&quot;</li>\n<li>对应自反框架性质</li>\n<li>GL 不包含全体 T 实例：某句在 PA 中可证，与 PA 自己证明该句的反射原则，是不同断言。标准可靠 PA 的“可证则真”在元层成立；总为真系统 GLS 包含 T 模式，却不对必然化闭合。</li>\n<li>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 3 章，印刷页 62–65；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-t-axiom-—-Axiom-T-(Factivity)","text":"df-t-axiom — Axiom T (Factivity)","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-modality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-implication","status":"resolved","id":"32c9990061b9749d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-implication]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Box:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ and\n$\\to:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{2}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ are fixed by\n[[89-df-box-modality]] and [[89-df-modal-implication]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-implication","status":"resolved","id":"32c9990061b9749d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Box:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ and\n$\\to:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{2}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ are fixed by\n[[89-df-box-modality]] and [[89-df-modal-implication]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Box:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\to:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{2}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}t\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathcal{A}_{T}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Box A\\to A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{A}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false}],"bytes":1184,"backlinks":[{"id":"64bdfb29fd90b6b0","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{A}_{T}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-t-axiom]])."},{"id":"8d331ca88ac9759e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"T axiom : 自反公理 $\\Box p \\rightarrow p$ (see [[89-df-t-axiom]])"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-405","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-t-axiom]]"}],"outgoing":["56c1b5b75a32ca1d","d246470e97fec132","32c9990061b9749d"]}